===Follow Pascal{{subst:void|<!--201090611-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Rivet Town|update|Clara and you found Pascal. It seemed to have been subdued by one of Svarog's automatic robot soldiers. However, you did not have a nice experience communicating with that robot soldier.<br />Anyways, the incident is mostly solved &mdash; Pascal finally returns to normal after being given the last shell, then walks on its own to lead you somewhere deep in Rivet Town.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
----
:'''Clara:''' I think this place used to be a restaurant. One time, I found a bunch of canned food here... The vagrants in the camp were so happy.
:'''Clara:''' However, I've always wondered...
:'''Clara:''' The light here... Why is it still on? This place has clearly been abandoned for a long time...
:'''Clara:''' Also, there's dust all over the place, but none of the equipment appears to be deteriorating.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've been wondering about that too...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is it possible that someone lives here?
::'''Clara:''' I don't think so... No one should be living here. I never saw anyone when I came here to hunt for supplies.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Maybe Rivet Town is haunted...
::'''Clara:''' Ah!? Are you saying we're... not alone...?
::'''Clara:''' No, no, no... Ghosts don't exist...
:'''Clara:''' Anyway, someone must be looking after this place. But who?
:'''Clara:''' And why...?
----
